@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber

participant "Temporal Server\n(Durable Timer)" as TempServer
participant "Temporal Worker\n(ActivityPlanWorkflow)" as Worker
participant "Notification Provider\n(Gateway / Mock)" as NotifGateway
participant "Laravel Backend API" as API
database "MySQL (dsh_db)" as DB
actor "Pasien MHLS" as Patient

TempServer -> TempServer : Durable Timer tercapai sesuai jadwal
TempServer -> Worker : Timer Fired! Resume Workflow execution
Worker -> Worker : Schedule Activity: SendActivityReminderActivity

Worker -> API : POST /api/internal/schedules/{id}/reminder-sent
activate API
API -> DB : UPDATE activity_schedules SET status = 'reminder_sent'
API -> DB : INSERT INTO notification_logs (recipient, message, status: 'success')
API --> Worker : 200 OK
deactivate API

Worker -> NotifGateway : Dispatch Push / Message Notification
NotifGateway --> Patient : Kirim Pengingat Aktivitas ("Saatnya tidur sebelum 22.00...")

Worker -> TempServer : Complete Activity
Worker -> TempServer : Start Report Window Timer (Menunggu Laporan Pasien)
@enduml
